{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38017","headline":"乙丑岁九月在萧滩镇驻泊两月忽得商马杨迢员外书贺余复除戎曹依旧承旨还缄後因书四十字 · 韩偓","name":"乙丑岁九月在萧滩镇驻泊两月忽得商马杨迢员外书贺余复除戎曹依旧承旨还缄後因书四十字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旅寓在江郊，秋风正寂寥。\n紫泥虚宠奖，白发已渔樵。\n事往凄凉在，时危志气销。\n若爲将朽质，犹拟杖於朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}